    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 35.287,
      "end": 38.351,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那么到底是什么菌竟然有如此大的威力呢？",
      "score": 0.2439,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1689,
