        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "竟/今",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么，到底是什么军今年有如此大的威力呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 38.548,
      "end": 40.758,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "它就是嗜肺军团菌。",
